          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Résumé: Observation de points lumineux clignotants, probablement un avion.",
          "text_sha256": "701a1680819503cf9322600e041d78ac72f89cbe262924c538ce77dbc650a4cc"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
